id=r8q_optimize
name=r8q optimizations
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=Merloch
description=Removes S22-donor components that are broken or wasteful on r8q (CameraLightSensor front-camera brightness cycling, non-functional SecureElement eSE) and silences their log spam, to improve battery, fluidity and reduce logd load. Runs as a mod so it wins over the legacy/ese patches.
